      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ahmad Bin Abu Muhammad Al Hajjal, from Dawood Bin Abu Yazeed, from the one who mentioned it, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> having said: ‘The pilgrim is such that the Light of the Hajj does not cease to be upon him for as long as he does not sin’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "11. Ahmad has narrated from abu Muhammad al-Hajjal, from Dawud ibn abu Yazid from those whom he has mentioned who has said the foiiowing: “Abu ‘ Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said that a pilgrim continues to live with the light of al-Hajj until he commits sins again and again.’” "
        ]
      }
